Hello everyone,

 =


I have exported a public key with the tpm2-tools using tpm2_readpublic in
the default tss format (I guess it is a TPM2B_PUBLIC structure).

 =


How can I load it into an TPM2B_PUBLIC or TPMT_PUBLIC object in tpm2-pytss,
so I can load it with the ESAPI.load_external() function? I have seen the
.from_pem() method, but I don't want to use pem format, because it does not
include the key attributes and other information.

 =


Best Regards,

Henry

 =



